{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"472e559d-f7dd-5511-9ef3-f10f451658b4:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a1653213dc7632ba1f31cbe80d93bc\",\"output\":\"{\\\"query\\\":\\\"Leonxlnx taste-skill design-taste-frontend SKILL.md dials variance motion density\\\",\\\"results\\\":[{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://opentrend.org/project/taste-skill\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Taste Skill AI Skills Open Source Project\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"This feature enables developers to customize the visual style of their web pages directly inside the configuration file by adjusting numerical dials from 1 to 10. ... These dials include DESIGN_VARIANCE (layout experimentation), MOTION_INTENSITY (animation depth), and VISUAL_DENSITY (information per viewport). When the AI agent parses these parameters, it maps the qualitative numbers to quantitative CSS design tokens rather than simple variables\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.skills.sh/leonxlnx/taste-skill/gpt-taste\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"gpt-taste — leonxlnx/taste-skill\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"- **Description:** Classic skill for GPT and Codex, opt-in: it runs only when called by name. ... Layout variance, a strict AIDA page structure and GSAP scroll motion.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://python.plainenglish.io/10-claude-code-and-codex-skills-most-developers-havent-tried-4e6916b26f49?gi=b3a6537e4ff6\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"10 Claude Code and Codex Skills Most Developers Haven’t Tried\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Taste Skill\\\\n**GitHub:** Leonxlnx/taste-skill\\\\nEver asked an AI to build a landing page and received the same purple gradient, rounded cards, and generic layout you’ve seen a hundred times?\\\\nTaste Skill aims to fix that. It guides coding agents through art direction, typography, spacing, color, imagery, and motion.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1792627200},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://substack.com/@firstninja/note/c-283982845\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Sairam Veereddy (@firstninja)\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"vibes.\\\\n**Taste Skill** tries to fix that.\\\\nIt is an open-source skill system that gives AI coding agents better frontend taste. ... The goal is simple: help AI generate cleaner layouts, stronger typography, better spacing, smoother motion, and more intentional UI instead of boring boilerplate. (tasteskill.dev) ... You can install it with: npx skills add Leonxlnx/taste-skill\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1782518400},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.ui-skills.com/skills/leonxlnx/gpt-tasteskill\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"gpt-taste Skill - Leonxlnx | UI Skills\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"gpt-taste Skill - Leonxlnx ... Leonxlnx\\\\nHigh-agency UX/UI skill with strict layout variance, typography, and GSAP motion engineering constraints.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.forgecat.ai/forgecat/leonxlnx_taste-skill\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"@forgecat/leonxlnx_taste-skill | ForgeCat\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"- **gpt-taste** — Elite UX/UI & Advanced GSAP Motion Engineer. Enforces Python-driven true randomization for layout variance, strict AIDA page structure, wide editorial typography (bans 6-line wraps), gapless bento grids, strict GSAP ScrollTriggers (pinning, stacking, scrubbing), inline micro-images, and massive section spacing.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1789516800},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.tasteskill.dev/\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Taste Skill | The Anti-Slop Frontend Framework\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Taste Skill | The Anti-Slop Frontend Framework for AI Agents ... Taste Skill plugs into any tool that reads SKILL.md files. ... Taste Skill gives your agent real rules for typography, spacing, color, layout and motion, so it stops reaching for the same template every time.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://abduzeedo.com/stop-slop-taste-skill-better-ai-design\\\